{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/semirings\/tropicalsemiring"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Semirings"}],"title":"TropicalSemiring","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TropicalSemiring"}],"externalID":"s:9Semirings16TropicalSemiringV","roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TropicalSemiring"}],"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Semirings\/TropicalSemiring.swift#L19","fileName":"TropicalSemiring.swift"}},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TropicalSemiring"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"_SemiringScalar"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"zero"},{"type":"text","text":" is +∞ ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int.max"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".infinity"},{"type":"text","text":"), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"one"},{"type":"text","text":" is 0, ⊕ is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"min"},{"type":"text","text":" and ⊗ is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"+"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<"},{"type":"text","text":" compares the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values, so shorter is better."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On integers ⊗ is a closed sum. "},{"code":".max","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (+∞, the zero) absorbs, then "},{"code":".min","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (−∞), and any other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sum traps on overflow. A finite sum that lands exactly on "},{"code":".max","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the zero, so an edge of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that weight carries no path."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On floating point the carrier is ℝ ∪ {+∞}, and ⊗ is "},{"code":"+","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", where "},{"code":".infinity","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" absorbs every finite"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value. −∞ is outside the carrier, and "},{"code":"-.infinity ⊗ .zero","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is NaN, not "},{"code":".zero","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". No algorithm"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"here computes that product, because each skips a "},{"code":".zero","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" distance and treats a NaN candidate as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no improvement. No operation checks for NaN. The ShortestPaths entry points trap on a NaN"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"weight."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["graph.dijkstraShortestPaths(from: s) { TropicalSemiring(length[$0]) }"]}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Operators","anchor":"Operators","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/TropicalSemiring\/_(_:_:)"],"generated":true},{"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/TropicalSemiring\/init(_:)"],"generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":